// Tests: `use cfg` resolves the native config module via its alias.
// Bug: IMPORT handler deferred the lazy proxy to loadModule("cfg"), whose
// lazy/native legs are exact-key only -> "Module not found: cfg" even though
// the plugin registers as "config" with aliases cfg/conf.
// Expected: prints PASS, exit 0.
use cfg
if cfg.load {
    print("PASS: use cfg resolved, cfg.load present")
} else {
    print("FAIL: cfg.load missing after use cfg")
}
